---
import Layout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Card from "../components/Card.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Akshyat Ankur Patel</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mt-2">AI Engineer & Data Scientist</p>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-gray-300">
      <p>
        I build end‑to‑end AI products – from data cleaning, feature engineering, and model tuning to deployment and LLM integration. 
        With 2+ years of backend engineering experience at <strong class="text-white">RedBus (GO-MMT Group)</strong>, I combine software craftsmanship with machine learning to deliver scalable, fault‑tolerant systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        Currently pursuing an MSc in Data Science and AI at <strong class="text-white">Middlesex University Dubai</strong>, I'm passionate about using generative AI, predictive modelling, and agentic workflows to solve real business problems.
      </p>
      <p>
        My recent work includes a live property price predictor for the UAE market (R² 0.73, deployed), a customer churn system (AUC 0.84) with AI‑generated retention advice, and an industrial energy simulator (R² > 0.96) used internally by a major Abu Dhabi mall.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm actively looking for AI Engineer, Data Scientist, or ML Engineer roles in Dubai or Europe. Let's connect.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4">Featured Projects</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <Card
        title="UAE Real Estate AI Analyzer"
        description="CatBoost price predictor (R²=0.73, RMSE=2.46M AED) with LLM explanation via Groq Llama 3.3"
        github="https://github.com/akshyat21/UAE-RealEstate-AI"
        demo="https://uae-realestate-ai-kjmsf4tshdkmtvlnzkgqx7.streamlit.app/"
      />
      <Card
        title="Customer Churn Prediction"
        description="Logistic regression (AUC=0.84) with AI-powered retention advice"
        github="https://github.com/akshyat21/AI-Churn-Prediction"
        demo="https://ai-churn-prediction-hpudyompmu5v7jnxk4epso.streamlit.app/"
      />
      <Card
        title="AI‑Powered Energy Simulator (Internship)"
        description="Ridge regression (R²>0.96) for Dalma Mall – used internally by engineering team"
        github="#"
        demo="#"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>